[statement]
A requested name does not give way to another requested name its best
candidate forbids, as a name the request does not name does
(`a-later-name-gives-way-to-a-requested-name-its-best-candidate-forbids`):
`a` and `e` are requested, and `e` 3, the best candidate for `e`, forbids
`a` 1, the one candidate for `a`. apk takes `e` 3 and refuses, though `e`
2 forbids nothing.

[repository]
P:a
V:1

P:e
V:3
D:!a

P:e
V:2

[request]
a
e

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   a-1:
|     breaks: e-3[!a]
|     satisfies: world[a]
refused
